 [], "sub_questions": [{"question_id": "1", "question": "", "image": "", "question_type": "", "option": []}, {"question_id": "2", "question": "", "image": "", "question_type": "", "option": []}, {"question_id": "3", "question": "", "image": "", "question_type": "", "option": []}, {"question_id": "4", "question": "", "image": "", "question_type": "", "option": []}, {"question_id": "5", "question": "", "image": "", "question_type": "", "option": []}, {"question_id": "6", "question": "", "image": "", "question_type": "", "option": []}], "answer": "(1)出现无色液滴： $ CO_{2}+Ca(OH)_{2}=CaCO_{3}\\downarrow+H_{2}O $\n\n(2)碱\n\n(3)作对照实验或空白实验\n\n(4)常温下，NaHCO₃溶液不稳定，能产生CO₂\n\n注意：若答对(5)(6)两小题奖励3分，化学总得分不超过40分。\n\n(5)小于(1分)\n\n(6)NaCl、CO₂(2分，合理答案均可)", "resolve": "", "source_year": "", "source_province": ""}, {"question_id": 17, "grade": "", "volume": "", "chapter": "", "section": "", "subject": "化学", "education_level": "", "question_content": "17.(5分)", "question_options": [], "question_images": [], "question_tables": [], "analysis_images": [], "difficulty": null, "question_type": "", "source": "", "knowledge_points": [], "sub_questions": [{"question_id": "1", "question": "", "image": "", "question_type": "", "option": []}, {"question_id": "2", "question": "", "image": "", "question_type": "", "option": []}], "answer": "(1)产物为水,无污染(1分)\n\n(2)解:设理论上需要 $ NaBH_{4} $的质量为 $ \\pi $。\n\n $$ \n\n\\begin{array}{c|c}\n\n & NaBH_{4} + 2H_{2}O = NaBO_{2} + 4H_{2} \\uparrow \\\\\n\n\\hline\n\n38 & 8 \\\\\n\n\\end{array}\n\n $$ \n\n $ \\pi $\n\n $$ \n\n\\frac{38}{\\pi} = \\frac{8}{12\\pi}\n\n $$ \n\nx = 57\n\n答:理论上需要 $ NaBH_{4} $的质量为57t。(4分)", "resolve": "", "source_year": "", "source_province": ""}]}